    "preamble": "Ramlal vs State on 22 May, 2018 Author: Manoj Kumar Garg Bench: Manoj Kumar Garg High Court Of Judicature For Rajasthan At Jodhpur S.B. Criminal Misc. Bail No. 4674 / 2018",
    "facts": "The petitioner has been arrested in connection with FIR No.118/2018 of Police Station Ratangarh, District Churu, for the offence punishable under Sections 419, 420, 272, 273 of IPC and Sections 104, 106 and 107 of the Trademark Act and Sections 51, 52 and 59 of the Food Standard & Safety Act. He has preferred this bail application under Section 439 Cr.P.C.",
    "arguments": "Mr. Bajrang Lal, (petitioner's brother), appears on behalf of the petitioner submits that the accused-petitioner is in judicial custody and the trial of the case will take sufficient long time to be concluded.",
